      "year": 1804
    },
    "precision": "year",
    "uncertainty": {
      "note": "Gale gives \"from July 1799 to April 1804\"; another Gale entry says Humboldt embarked on June 5, 1799 and landed at Cumana. Smithsonian Magazine gives 1799 to 1804. Altitude reached on Chimborazo differs between Gale entries (19,289 vs 17,900 feet), so no figure is used."
