  "reviewer_note": "Least sure: route detail. Only three stops are named with a place and year on opened pages; Mexico and Cuba are mentioned but their visits are not dated or placed precisely, and one Gale entry says Cuba came before the Andes while another says after Mexico, so they are not waypoints. Smithsonian Magazine page has no publication date I could read. Cumana point is Wikidata city centre.",
